{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22333","headline":"劝酒寄元九 · 白居易","name":"劝酒寄元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薤叶有朝露，槿枝无宿花。\n君今亦如此，促促生有涯。\n既不逐禅僧，林下学楞伽。\n又不随道士，山中链丹砂。\n百年夜分半，一岁春无多。\n何不饮美酒？胡然自悲嗟。\n俗号销愁药，神速无以加。\n一杯驱世虑，两杯反天和。\n三杯即酩酊，或笑任狂歌。\n陶陶复兀兀，吾孰知其他。\n况在名利途，平生有风波。\n深心藏陷穽，巧言织网罗。\n举目非不见，不醉欲如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}